From: mochiOS Developers <developers@mochios.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] x86/mboot: provide the device control protocol

Replace the one-shot shared-ring probe with a versioned device control
service. Negotiate capabilities, enumerate and describe assigned devices,
start a session, answer health checks, and return stable status codes.
Keep servicing requests after boot from a poll-based kernel worker.

Signed-off-by: mochiOS Developers <developers@mochios.dev>
---

--- a/arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mboot.c
+++ b/arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mboot.c
@@ -9,8 +9,10 @@
